  "faq": {
    "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "subtitle": "Everything you need to know about Shabos Rent",
    "q1": "How does the Swap feature work?",
    "a1": "The Swap feature allows you to exchange your apartment with another user for a specific weekend. Both parties must have the Swap toggle turned ON in their dashboard. When you find a match, you can send a swap request.",
    "q2": "Are all users verified?",
    "a2": "Yes, we require all users to go through a verification process before they can list an apartment or send swap requests, ensuring a safe community.",
    "q3": "Can I just rent an apartment without swapping?",
    "a3": "Absolutely! Many users list their apartments for rent only. You can use the search widget and select \"Rent\" to find available rentals.",
    "q4": "Is there a fee for swapping?",
    "a4": "We charge a small service fee for successful swaps to cover our platform costs and verification services. Premium users have free unlimited swaps.",
